-- Public judging demo. Three shared accounts (specialist, guardian, examiner), one clearly labelled
-- demo child, consent for that demo child only, a starter plan and synthetic sample history so the
-- learning map is populated on first sign-in. Real children are untouched: their consent rule still applies.
-- The password is deliberately public (bundled in the site), so these accounts must never hold real data.

